    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Clamath Search &amp; Rescue</strong> has called upon YOU to aid them in finding missing people. Equipped with just a flashlight and a pistol, you must navigate your way through the treacherous woods in order to find your victim safely.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/9af3cd9aaf3b8ec0d2c0a38c91f3dcee.poster.avif?t=1752162895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/9af3cd9aaf3b8ec0d2c0a38c91f3dcee.webm?t=1752162895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/9af3cd9aaf3b8ec0d2c0a38c91f3dcee.mp4?t=1752162895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There is an abundance of creatures in these woods, some out to get you, some not. Be careful not to make too much noise and keep yourself sane. You are provided with a logbook to help you retrace where the victim could have gone. You have until 6AM to find them, if you make it out alive. Keep an ear out for any breathing, if the missing victim is alive, that is. That's it, good luck and thank you for your loyalty to <strong>Clamath Search &amp; Rescue!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/2b7189935a9dba5a3a37d0fd3d46441c.poster.avif?t=1752162895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/2b7189935a9dba5a3a37d0fd3d46441c.webm?t=1752162895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/2b7189935a9dba5a3a37d0fd3d46441c.mp4?t=1752162895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features Include:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed pixel art</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive &amp; haunting ambience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie lighting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All kinds of creatures\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items to be logged in your notebook</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things that are not supposed to be there</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Sets of stairs</strong></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS</span>\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Clamath Search &amp; Rescue</strong> has called upon YOU to aid them in finding missing people. Equipped with just a flashlight and a pistol, you must navigate your way through the treacherous woods in order to find your victim safely.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/9af3cd9aaf3b8ec0d2c0a38c91f3dcee.poster.avif?t=1752162895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/9af3cd9aaf3b8ec0d2c0a38c91f3dcee.webm?t=1752162895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/9af3cd9aaf3b8ec0d2c0a38c91f3dcee.mp4?t=1752162895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There is an abundance of creatures in these woods, some out to get you, some not. Be careful not to make too much noise and keep yourself sane. You are provided with a logbook to help you retrace where the victim could have gone. You have until 6AM to find them, if you make it out alive. Keep an ear out for any breathing, if the missing victim is alive, that is. That's it, good luck and thank you for your loyalty to <strong>Clamath Search &amp; Rescue!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/2b7189935a9dba5a3a37d0fd3d46441c.poster.avif?t=1752162895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/2b7189935a9dba5a3a37d0fd3d46441c.webm?t=1752162895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827240/extras/2b7189935a9dba5a3a37d0fd3d46441c.mp4?t=1752162895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features Include:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed pixel art</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive &amp; haunting ambience</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie lighting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All kinds of creatures\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items to be logged in your notebook</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Things that are not supposed to be there</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Sets of stairs</strong></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS\u00a0DO NOT GO UP ANY SET OF STAIRS</span>\u00a0</p>",
